{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/910188-allergic-reaction-to-drivthru-rpg-books","id":910188,"title":"Allergic Reaction to Drivthru RPG Books?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-06-08T10:46:14-07:00","id":910188,"title":"Allergic Reaction to Drivthru RPG Books?","content":"I've ordered several POD books from the website but starting with 2nd Edition Requiem I have noticed that the hardbacks are causing a small allergic reaction on my skin. There is also a pretty strong smell that comes from them as well that I don't notice with the paperback printings. Has anyone else had this same sort of reaction? I have a pretty strong latex allergy so I was wondering if that was somehow used in the covers or something similar?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1007-merinoc","name":"Merinoc","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"43"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-08T19:25:36-07:00","id":910489,"title":"","content":"Some book binding companies use a latex based powder to keep things from sticking together. I don't know where you are located but I've had no smell or allergic reactions to any of the books I've ordered off drive thru. Have you contacted them with this issue?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-09T19:42:14-07:00","id":911387,"title":"","content":"I haven't yet, I was curious to see if anyone had any sort of similar reaction before I did. Which, given the lack of replies I'm going to guess no :P I also wanted to rule out everything else it could possibly be first. But I will shoot them a message just to be sure. I wasn't aware of the use of latex based powders.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1007-merinoc","name":"Merinoc","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"43"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-10T03:03:59-07:00","id":911548,"title":"","content":"its mostly used on the cover plates to keep them from sticking in the press. or on high gloss paper","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-11T21:56:01-07:00","id":912640,"title":"","content":"They might also have different processes at different sites. I know I've seen people handle PoD books that have known latex allergies without issue for what that's worth. The only scent I've noticed is the slight scorched scent of recently electrically applied ink which fades fairly quickly.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-04T21:30:43-07:00","id":944119,"title":"","content":"Out of curiosity, what are your symptoms? Because I broke out in a manner consistent with poison ivy a couple weeks ago even though I didn't seem to come into contact with any patches of it in my yard, but do have a copy of EX3. It'd be a bit of a delay, though, since I ordered it about the time that POD for it was first available.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}